abstract: "21-layer Lean 4 tower formalizing Beal Conjecture dependencies. v0.4.0 checkpoint: Interfaces Typed. B04_QExpansion_Core: QExpansionCoeff, HeckeEigenvalue — [] axioms. B05_Modularity_Core: FreyCurve05Core, ModularityHypothesisTyped — [] axioms. B05_Modularity: modularity_hypothesis openly axiomatized; only new footprint is [propext, modularity_hypothesis]. B20_Beal_Core: IsBealSolution20Core with real arithmetic (2 < x, A^x + B^y = C^z), BealAssembly20Core — [] axioms. Tower complete: p||N → M*p=N → S2(2)=0 → Modularity Hypothesis → Beal. CI green: 2359/2359 bricks, 0 sorry, 0 Prop:=True stubs."
